%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% Scenario: a form with text and an image. The body shows a resident
% font and paints a gray image; the form XObject's own resources name
% the font and the image, and the page places the form twice.
/F << /FormType 1 /BBox [0 0 160 80] /Matrix [1 0 0 1 0 0]
  /PaintProc { pop
    /Helvetica findfont 24 scalefont setfont
    10 50 moveto (Form) show
    gsave 100 10 translate 50 50 scale
    2 2 8 [2 0 0 -2 0 2] <0055AAFF> image grestore } >> def
100 100 translate F execform
150 300 translate F execform
showpage
